; A Control subtree under a MODULATED Node2D ancestor — the ONE variable no
; other fixture moves. A non-Control ancestor contributes no node of its own and
; its Control descendants promote up, so a promoted Control that never consults
; the ancestor's `modulate` paints its own untinted colour. The `self_modulate`
; on the same node must NOT reach the child; the untinted sibling holds the
; reference colour beside it.

